WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:08.100
Open the Calendar

2
00:00:08.100 --> 00:00:12.300
Touch and hold the wand

3
00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:15.800
Replan My Week…

4
00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:19.300
A block that passed without work comes off…

5
00:00:19.300 --> 00:00:22.800
…and the work goes back into this week's free time

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:26.500
Every move is a checkbox — then Apply

7
00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:37.000
The week is planned again — tap any block to adjust it
